                "description": "Brass Accents D05-K650-GEO, Crystal Egg Knobset with Oval Beaded Backplate - The Crystal Egg Knobset with Oval Beaded Backplate has a classic look that makes it a great choice for historic homes. The beading along the outside if the escutcheon plate is a nice detail that keeps this latchset from feeling too plain. The Georgetown Knobset with Revere Plate is available in dummy, passage, and privacy functions. Choose from a wide variety of finishes including polished brass, polished nickel, and oil rubbed bronze. It will fit doors that are 1-3/8 inches thick or 1-3/4 inches thick with either 2-3/8 inch or 2-3/4 inch backsets.",
